# sdist scope: ship everything needed to audit, rebuild and re-verify the
# release from the tarball — sources, C kernels, full test suite (including
# the tests/ subdirectories), docs, examples, benchmarks and tooling.
# Deliberately excluded: build outputs and local run artifacts.
#
# package.json and scripts/ are included because the shipped test suite reads
# them: tests/test_release_metadata.py opens package.json and
# tests/test_workflow_graph.py imports scripts/check_workflows.py. CI
# workflows stay excluded by policy (asserted in the reproducible-build job);
# the workflow-graph test skips itself when they are absent.
include README.md LICENSE CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff codemeta.json pyproject.toml setup.py package.json
graft src
graft tests
graft docs
graft examples
graft benchmarks
graft tools
graft packaging
graft scripts
global-exclude *.py[cod]
global-exclude __pycache__/*
global-exclude *.egg-info/*
prune site
prune dist
prune build
prune guided-fit-results
